<p>Your gloom has become a sanctuary from the outside world. Damage from any attack that originates beyond the boundary of your gloom is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 15%, 19%, 22%, 24%.</acronym></p><p>Each point in Gloom talents increases your Mindpower (current total: <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 4, 7, 9, 12</acronym>).</p>